              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo, eigwala lirivuga n'amaani, okweta Abaisiraeli boonaboona abaliba mu Assiria ni mu Misiri, baidha baasinza Musengwa Katonda ku lusozi olutukuvu mu Yerusalemu.",
